\n\nYou can change the appearance of the character (e.g., hair, eye shape, etc.) to fit the design.\nThe girl is 155cm and the boy is 175cm \n\nI also resent my first request and I can’t wait to see the beautiful artwork （ ᐢ o̴̶̷̤ ̫ o̴̶̷̤ ᐢ ）I am really excited so I wanted to apply for another commission.💞💞\n\nThank you so much for reading this long message! I love your artwork with all my heart!🥰🩷🙇‍♀️🩷", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oishi___na/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3391036, "client_id": 2690856, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/de45b529/uploads/origins/8cbcedb2-5ffd-4d6f-926f-f006e2315f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61dcd33f609e78e1500c1d73aa8fbaf5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de45b529/uploads/origins/8cbcedb2-5ffd-4d6f-926f-f006e2315f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61dcd33f609e78e1500c1d73aa8fbaf5, https://si.imgix.net/de45b529/uploads/origins/8cbcedb2-5ffd-4d6f-926f-f006e2315f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f50624b131948febbb096bf99a128818 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de45b529/uploads/origins/8cbcedb2-5ffd-4d6f-926f-f006e2315f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=367044fa7bad81e30df53a0cc7394073 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/de45b529/uploads/origins/8cbcedb2-5ffd-4d6f-926f-f006e2315f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=573e54956972a17a3cfdc23ac4c7fcbd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de45b529/uploads/origins/8cbcedb2-5ffd-4d6f-926f-f006e2315f96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=573e54956972a17a3cfdc2